1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:02,846
Will your external auditor catch fraud?

2
00:00:02,966 --> 00:00:05,116
In our view, that's a myth.

3
00:00:05,236 --> 00:00:09,982
An audit tests samples. It isn't designed to find everything.

4
00:00:10,102 --> 00:00:13,759
Preventing fraud starts with your own controls.

5
00:00:13,879 --> 00:00:16,604
Two people approve every payment.

6
00:00:16,724 --> 00:00:22,539
Bank changes confirmed on a number you already hold.

7
00:00:22,659 --> 00:00:28,295
Someone other than the preparer reviews reconciliations.

8
00:00:28,415 --> 00:00:33,686
Our audit & risk advisory reviews controls before year-end.

9
00:00:33,806 --> 00:00:38,470
Preparing for your auditors? Talk to us.
